HEALTHCARE NOTICE:

This software is designed for healthcare workflow management. When used with
actual patient data, ensure compliance with:
- HIPAA (Health Insurance Portability and Accountability Act)
- GDPR (General Data Protection Regulation)
- Local healthcare data protection regulations

The software includes security features and audit logging, but proper
deployment, configuration, and operational procedures are the responsibility
of the implementing organization.

MEDICAL DISCLAIMER:

This software is a workflow management tool and does not provide medical
advice, diagnosis, or treatment. All clinical decisions must be made by
qualified healthcare professionals. The AI-assisted features require human
review and approval before use in clinical practice.
